    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "2. The case of the prosecution is that complainant lodged a complaint alleging that he is a labourer and having four children.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 947,
      "end": 1073,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23030775785446167
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Ajay son of Ishnath Parshad and Jaggu used to visit his home.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1074,
      "end": 1135,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1074,
          "end": 1078
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishnath Parshad",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1086,
          "end": 1101
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaggu",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1106,
          "end": 1111
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2068765014410019
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "They came in the contact of his family members.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1136,
      "end": 1183,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.226066455245018
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "On 16.04.2022, when he was present at home, his daughter on the pretext of purchasing something had left home and did not return.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1184,
      "end": 1313,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "16.04.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1187,
          "end": 1197
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2560975253582001
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "He went to home of Ajay and Jaggu who were 1 of 4 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:055808 2023:PHHC:055808 not present at their home.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1314,
      "end": 1445,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1333,
          "end": 1337
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaggu",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1342,
          "end": 1347
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19254784286022186
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Their mobiles were found 'switched off'.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1446,
      "end": 1486,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24535152316093445
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "They have enticed his daughter on the pretext of marriage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1487,
      "end": 1545,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20480644702911377
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "On 29.04.2022, statement of the prosecutrix was recorded under Section 164 Cr.P.C. wherein she did not utter even a single word against the petitioner except stating that she had left her home as her father used to give her beatings.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1546,
      "end": 1780,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "29.04.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1550,
          "end": 1560
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1610,
          "end": 1621
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1622,
          "end": 1629
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2782023847103119
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "She had left her home at her own accord.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1781,
      "end": 1821,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2718147933483124
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "On 16.07.2022,\nanother statement of the prosecutrix under Section 164 Cr.P.C. was recorded wherein she disclosed that petitioner abetted Ajay in kidnapping her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1822,
      "end": 1982,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "16.07.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1825,
          "end": 1835
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1880,
          "end": 1891
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1892,
          "end": 1899
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1959,
          "end": 1963
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26590898633003235
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "She was kept in a rented accommodation in Bihar where Ajay repeatedly committed rape.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1983,
      "end": 2068,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bihar",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2025,
          "end": 2030
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2037,
          "end": 2041
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2552469074726105
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Jaggu financially helped Ajay.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2069,
      "end": 2099,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Jaggu",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2069,
          "end": 2074
        },
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2094,
          "end": 2098
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23294752836227417
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Xxxxx vs Xxxxx on 20 April, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/61597459/\n1 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2100,
      "end": 2192,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "20 April, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2119,
          "end": 2133
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.051868125796318054
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner, inter alia contends that there is no allegation of rape against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2193,
      "end": 2308,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15122224390506744
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "The prosecutrix had eloped with co-accused-Ajay.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2309,
      "end": 2357,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2352,
          "end": 2356
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2646356523036957
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "The prosecutrix stands examined and she has turned hostile.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2358,
      "end": 2417,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22838319838047028
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "The prosecutrix in her first statement under Section 164 Cr.P.C. did not name the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2418,
      "end": 2511,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2463,
          "end": 2474
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2475,
          "end": 2482
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24885737895965576
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "In her second statement, under the influence of her parents, she had named the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2512,
      "end": 2602,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24835024774074554
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "The petitioner is in custody since 25.05.2022 and he is not involved in any other offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2603,
      "end": 2693,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "25.05.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2638,
          "end": 2648
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2463722974061966
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "The petitioner has been wrongly implicated in the commission of alleged offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2694,
      "end": 2775,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29551562666893005
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "There is no possibility of flee from justice.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2776,
      "end": 2821,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1945623904466629
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "4. Custody certificate dated 19.04.2023 is taken on record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2822,
      "end": 2882,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "19.04.2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2852,
          "end": 2862
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08501315116882324
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "As per custody certificate, the petitioner is in custody since 25.05.2022 and he is not involved in any other offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2883,
      "end": 3001,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "25.05.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2946,
          "end": 2956
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09557192772626877
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "2 of 4 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:055808 2023:PHHC:055808 5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3002,
      "end": 3067,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:055808 2023:PHHC:055808 5",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3010,
          "end": 3066
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.06018028408288956
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "Learned State Counsel submits that police report has already been filed and charges stand framed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3068,
      "end": 3165,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08567705005407333
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "He further submits that out of 21 witnesses, 5 have already been examined which includes prosecutrix.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3166,
      "end": 3267,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09761285781860352
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "He fairly confirms that prosecutrix has turned hostile.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3268,
      "end": 3323,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17179927229881287
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "He further submits that main accused Ajay has till date not been arrested.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3324,
      "end": 3398,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3361,
          "end": 3365
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13216780126094818
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "6. In the case in hand, the prosecutrix has turned hostile and she had not named petitioner in her first statement recorded under Section 164 Cr.P.C.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3400,
      "end": 3549,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3530,
          "end": 3541
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3542,
          "end": 3549
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3457065522670746
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "There is no allegation of rape against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3550,
      "end": 3604,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5367850065231323
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "It is co-accused Ajay against whom there are allegations of rape.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3605,
      "end": 3670,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ajay",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3622,
          "end": 3626
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5248858332633972
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 41,
      "text": "The petitioner is in custody since 25.05.2022 and he is not involved in any other offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3671,
      "end": 3761,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "25.05.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3706,
          "end": 3716
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5212764143943787
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 42,
      "text": "The Trial Court yet has to return definite findings on the role of the petitioner qua alleged offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3762,
      "end": 3864,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5803678035736084
